    "text": "If the center and radius of the circle <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math> are respectively <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>&#946;</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#947;</mi></math>, then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#947;</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> is equal to",
